invariant: INV-41
file: src/rsa_mont64_blocks.c
catches: rsa_blocks_equiv_test
reason: row i of the square reads a_{i+1} at word i + 1 where it needs
  a_{i+1} moved up one bit, so the row adds the cross product a_i a_{i+1}
  once where the square holds it twice. bin/rsa_blocks_equiv_test holds
  rsa_mont64_blocks_square to the blocks' multiplication of a by itself.

--- old
        v[i + 1] = a[i + 1] << 1;
--- new
        v[i + 1] = a[i + 1];
